    "Same-IdeaLake exact wall-envelope reservation and slot authority rechecked at admission; actual action timeout equals persistent permit. No automatic refund or unknown-work adoption.",
    "Durable queue Execute/Wait/Stop: empty/resource waits create no attempt/claim/child/reservation; Stop is sticky and cannot be triggered by local idle while shared reservations remain.",
    "Owned READY/RUNNING before GO, monotonic timeout, whole-tree closure before out-of-writer artifact preparation, same-effect artifact/lifecycle publication with post-terminal metadata fences, then budget settlement.",
    "Explicit zero observations, not zero scores; configurable Domain/Policy, analyze, CPU replica and cross-domain acceptance remain subsequent work."
  ],
